msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics are served at <code>/metrics</code> with no token, so anybody who can reach this instance can read them. They carry counts only — how many applications exist, not whose — and nothing that names a person, a company or an application, which is why this is a reasonable thing to leave open on a private network. Set POSTULO_METRICS_TOKEN if it is not."
msgstr ""
"Prometheus-Metrike ginn op <code>/metrics</code> ouni Token ugebueden, also kann se jiddereen liesen, deen dës Installatioun erreecht. Si enthalen nëmmen Zuelen — wéi vill Kandidaturen et gëtt, net weem seng — an näischt, wat eng Persoun, eng Firma oder eng Kandidatur nennt, an dofir ass et vernünfteg, dat an engem private Netz opzeloossen. Setzt POSTULO_METRICS_TOKEN, wann et net esou ass."

