msgid ""
"Somebody arriving through this provider is signed in as the account holding the address it gives, so long as the provider says that address is verified. That makes one question worth answering: does this provider only call an address verified when the person proved they hold it? If you run it, almost certainly. If it is somebody else's, check before you rely on it. Set POSTULO_OIDC_LINK_BY_EMAIL to false to require each person to sign in here once and connect the provider from their own account page."
msgstr ""
"Wien iwwer dësen Ubidder kënnt, gëtt bei deem Kont ugemellt, deen d'Adress huet, déi den Ubidder gëtt — virausgesat, den Ubidder seet, datt déi Adress bestätegt ass. Dat mécht eng Fro derwäert: nennt dësen Ubidder eng Adress nëmmen dann bestätegt, wann d'Persoun bewisen huet, datt se hir gehéiert? Wann Dir en selwer bedreift, ganz sécher jo. Wann en engem anere gehéiert, kuckt no, ier Dir Iech drop verlooss. Setzt POSTULO_OIDC_LINK_BY_EMAIL op false, fir ze verlaangen, datt sech all Persoun hei eemol umellt an den Ubidder vun hirer eegener Kontsäit aus verbënnt."

